  "content": [
    {
      "text": "had stolen the images that were her father’s, Gen. 31:19. Thou shalt not steal, Ex. 20:15 (Lev. 19:11; Deut. 5:19; Matt. 19:18; Mark 10:19; Luke 18:20; Rom. 13:9; 2 Ne. 26:32; Mosiah 13:22; D&C 59:6). he that stealeth a man, and selleth him, Ex. 21:16. If a man shall steal an ox … he shall restore five, Ex. 22:1. If a man be found stealing any of his brethren … that thief shall die, Deut. 24:7. do not despise a thief, if he steal to satisfy his soul, Prov. 6:30. By swearing, and lying, and killing, and stealing, Hosea 4:2. every one that stealeth shall be cut off, Zech. 5:3.",
